From: Frédéric Danis <frederic.danis@collabora.com>
Subject: [PATCH] obexd: client: Fix connect RX MTU
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/bluez/bluez/commit/99abc8a9e1e1d256749e519a1758bf9a8576c468

Backport the constructor argument-order fix only. g_obex_new takes RX, TX;
the transport's getpacketopt callback returns TX, RX.

--- a/obexd/client/session.c
+++ b/obexd/client/session.c
@@ -371,7 +371,7 @@
 	else
 		type = G_OBEX_TRANSPORT_STREAM;
 
-	obex = g_obex_new(io, type, tx_mtu, rx_mtu);
+	obex = g_obex_new(io, type, rx_mtu, tx_mtu);
 	if (obex == NULL)
 		goto done;
 
